import os
import re
import json

MARS_JS = r'd:\vedic-astrology-app - 2\frontend\src\data\planets\mars.js'

libra_data = {
    "effect": "Mars in Libra makes the individuals tolerant, assertive, cooperative, and with a balanced temperament helping you pursue your dreams and ambitions with peace and harmony.\n\nYou are attracted towards emotional fulfillment, and hence you are quite romantic and embrace emotional intimacy as against physical intimacy.\n\nFurthermore, you are extravagant in personal relationships, cooperative in interpersonal communications and make friendly relations rather than getting involved in conflicts with loved ones or in making enemies. Mars in Libra can be indecisive as they tend to delay their decisions, evaluating all options before taking any final decision.\n\nMars in Libra have a charming personality owing to which they remain active in any relationship and rarely appear upset in public. They are experts in solving problems due to their expertise in managing conflicts with a compromising attitude and the desire to gain approval. They like to avoid confrontations and can be quite manipulative and assertive in achieving their desires.",
    "retrogradeEffect": "When Mars is retrograde in Libra, it can make you introverted in expressing your feelings. Since Mars is the planet of aggression, when it goes retrograde in Libra, you may witness professional environment turning conflictive and face aggravation and frustration over minor issues in your daily routine.\n\nRetrograde motion may make you angry with everyone in personal/professional relationships where your action-oriented approach takes over your usual habit of compromise, diplomacy, harmony, and ability to bring balance in your relationships.\n\nDuring this period, it may be hard to be assertive in your personal/professional relationships as you are constantly worried about the reactions you are likely to receive from others. You may feel restricted in relationships, but retrograde period is the best time to focus your energy and attention to review your relationships and create a delicate balance by being assertive, direct, and diplomatic.",
    "combustEffect": "When Mars is combusted in Libra, it means that Mars is in the same sign as the Sun, or it is too close to the Sun in degrees in your horoscope. When Mars is combusted, it loses some of its power and individuality due to the overwhelming influence of Sun on the qualities of the combusted planet.\n\nCombust Mars in Libra may affect your usual courage, energy and assertiveness creating a lack of motivation and decreasing your output in work and in relationships. You will not be able to complete your tasks at the committed time and face an inability to take decisive action over your ideas.\n\nIt can also bring about various kinds of conflicts in your relations, common interests, viewpoints, and despite your efforts of sticking to your matters of concern, things turn out the opposite.",
    "houses": {
        "1": "Mars in Libra here gives a personal charm and charisma in your personality making others attracted to your balanced and harmonious attitude. You have the ability of being assertive and diplomatic at the same time to overcome any contradictions. You prefer to avoid any kind of confrontation with others and loved ones.\n\nHowever, if anyone instigates you against your nature, you will not hesitate to take a stand for yourself and others.\n\nMars in Libra can make you impulsive and indecisive making you invest your energy on being honest with others. Overall, you are focused with a desire to create harmony and balance in your relationships, but it is crucial for you to be natural in relationships rather than trying to make others happy.",
        "2": "Mars in Libra here makes you move with diplomacy wherein your attention is to balance everything in your surroundings and relationships; however, you are protective about your resources, possessions, and ethics in life. Mars in Libra makes you honest and hard working in achieving your ambitions where your work approach is motivated by harmony and peace.\n\nYou have no interest in treading over the interests of others for personal gains and wish for everyone to succeed. Mars in Libra influences your inclination towards materialistic comforts and financial security making you work hard to attain them. You have a liking for luxury and beauty, instigating expenditures to attain items of beauty that will add essence to your splendour and your lifestyle.\n\nFurthermore, you will have a desire for materialistic possessions, but you are equally focused on making your familial relationships cordial. With an eye to create balance and harmony in relationships, you give significance to all relationships.",
        "3": "Mars in Libra here indicates that you have desires, that originate from the need of social interaction and your actions are influenced by your need of peace and harmony. Most of your personality traits are influenced by the desire to preserve social harmony. Often, this placement of Mars in Libra creates a natural opposition in your relationships wherein your desires and efforts to please others hamper your quality of assertiveness. This makes you work for the benefit of others as your actions are likely to be dominated by others, making you dependent.\n\nMars in Libra grants you good communication, especially when it comes to defending others’ rights with honesty. You often communicate to bring change for others but when it comes to expressing your own desires and ambitions, you require other’s guidance.",
        "4": "Mars in Libra here receives power due to its exaltation making you a diplomatic individual with a knack of creating a harmonious atmosphere in your home and relationships owing to your influence and efforts. You will make expenditures to beautify your home and surroundings, bringing mental and aesthetic satisfaction to you.\n\nWhen it comes to making decisions in relationships, you take longer time than others as you have a tendency of weighing pros and cons at every step which may frustrate others. Despite being indecisive, your decisions are well balanced that include every family member’s interest. Your efforts and energy are channelled into your home and familial relationships making everyone feel appreciated and loved.\n\nHowever, your equilibrium may get disrupted when you feel injustice or challenged making you lose your composure and react strongly towards the situation.",
        "5": "Mars in Libra here makes you a creative, energetic, and enthusiastic individual who possesses a desire for balance in life and you express this trait through your creative pursuits and relationships. You have an optimistic approach towards life and others and are willing to stand by others, supporting them morally/financially. You have a strong inclination towards the opposite sex making you express your feelings creatively to your partner. You seek a partner who matches your enthusiasm and ambition to succeed in all relationships with peace, harmony and balance.\n\nMars in Libra at times can have a challenging effect on your relationships where you may lose your calm and composure over petty issues, causing friction in your relationship with family, partner, and children. You may also act irresponsibly in your relationships making you less sensitive towards your partners’ wishes, affecting your romantic relationship adversely.",
        "6": "Mars in Libra here signifies your daily routine, health, work, and your rivals. This placement makes you face conflicts with grace, diplomacy, and honesty as you channel your energy in creating balance. This may make you seem indecisive, but this delay is with thoughtful deliberation making you analyse all options for your success.\n\nYou love to have a clean/organized workspace and love to work with the cooperation of others in a team inspiring a feeling of collective win for all. You are likely to be health conscious and follow a good diet and exercise regime to keep yourself fit mentally and physically.\n\nMars in Libra can also pose some challenges making you invite added work responsibilities stemming from an inability to refuse others and end up over committing yourself. It is advised to prioritize your needs and requirements before committing yourself to other’s responsibilities.",
        "7": "Mars in Libra here governs your relationships and reflects the positive and negative influences in your marital relations/professional partnership. You are an individual that refrains from getting into any conflict before analysing all sides of the argument.\n\nYour professional life will witness gains through partnership as you thrive in teamwork and let others take lead to achieve common goals. You are the catalyst in the team who makes efforts to maintain balance and equality in all relationships. \n\nYou have a desire to connect with your partner at a deeper level with passionate bonding and emotional connectivity. In your relationships, you believe in working things out and finding solutions that are beneficial for all. Overall, it is good to maintain harmony and peace in relationships, but it is also necessary to maintain personal space for your own needs and desires.",
        "8": "Mars in Libra blesses you with a unique blend of diplomatic traits and intense determination making you garner other’s trust and friendship. Your approach in relationship is not aggressive but influential like a gentle breeze that guides the ship to sail through the ocean.\n\nYou have a strong connection with your partner owing to an intense physical intimacy. However, you may suffer from a fear of betrayal from your partner that may weaken your trust issues. Despite this, your positive attitude towards life brings balance in your personal and love life making you forge ahead in life. It is advised to leave the past behind and it will bring beneficial developments in your love relations.\n\nProfessionally, you are quite hard working, and you may make a successful career as a researcher or psychologist and your passion for work motivates you to work harder.\n\nMars in Libra in the 8th house makes your energy directed towards understanding the deeper meanings of life. However, be cautious as this placement can make you work with extreme focus and efforts on small things which may make you frustrated.",
        "9": "Mars in Libra here makes you a very learned person and an insightful visionary. This unique blend of energy helps to make your relationship happy with your spouse. You will enjoy happiness with your loved ones and will have the opportunity to progress immensely after marriage and gain wealth due to your partner’s luck. You are not hasty for any conflicts in relationships but will prefer to take a balanced approach especially with your loved ones.\n\nThe planetary alignment of Mars in Libra makes you competent enough to channel your energies into activities that promote honesty and integrity. You tend to explore, negotiate and compromise for healthy relationships when you are solving any disagreement in your work front.",
        "10": "Mars in Libra here creates more focus on your career and professional ambition, granting you the ability of achieving your targets with hard work and efforts along with the cooperation of others. You have a refined blend of action/diplomacy in your professional ventures making you strategic in attaining gains.\n\nYou have a natural ability of establishing balance as a mediator when any conflicting situation arises on the work front. You avoid initiating opposition in any contradictory situation but prefer to negotiate with others to find a peaceful resolution with a compatible ground for all. However, it is likely that others may take your cool behaviour for granted. In addition, career is your area of significance wherein you channel your energy to work hard for success.\n\nYou believe that your ambition is not only for personal success but also for the success of your organization and team. It is advised not to indulge a lot in collective career progress as it may restrict your career progress.",
        "11": "Mars in Libra in the 11th house indicates that your energy and efforts are directed towards your connections in friendships and social groups that share common interests with you. You do not wish for laser focus and attention when working in a group but strive for everyone’s benefits. Hence, you are that friend who organizes group outings and ensure that everyone has their share of enjoyment in the group.\n\nThis placement indicates your underlying desire for recognition and approval by any influential group as your involvement with them could form the base for fulfilment of your desires in future. You rely on other’s approval for your self- esteem as getting opinions from others gives you a sense of self-achievement socially.",
        "12": "Mars in Libra here indicates that you are insecure and need other’s approval to maintain your confidence. You may become reluctant to be assertive in your relationships and your actions and interaction with others are likely to be dominated by other’s desires. It is difficult for you to take independent action or express your desires owing to a fear of disapproval of others. You often tend to suppress your own desires and ambitions to maintain harmony, putting you in a constant battle with yourself, as you try to balance your own needs with those of others.\n\nThis placement makes you control your anger and frustration, and you will find yourself contemplating subconsciously over situations/relationships wondering if you could have dealt with them in a different way.\n\nFurthermore, you have the unique ability to understand others’ struggles, making you a great supporter owing to your compassion and empathy towards everyone. However, you must be wary not to avoid your needs in this process.\n\nIn addition, you do not have an attraction for materialistic things and instead are more focused on understanding your hidden desires and feelings. Your aims and motivations tend to be clear in the social race to please others."
    },
    "remedies": []
}

with open(MARS_JS, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:
    content = f.read()

signs_match = re.search(r'signs:\s*\{', content)
if signs_match:
    insertion_point = signs_match.end()
    libra_json = "      Libra: " + json.dumps(libra_data, indent=8) + ","
    new_content = content[:insertion_point] + "\n" + libra_json + content[insertion_point:]
    
    with open(MARS_JS, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:
        f.write(new_content)
    print("Added Mars in Libra to mars.js")
else:
    print("Could not find signs object in mars.js")
